{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a916b6fb2e6691efb56598d8f67529e7a80c63521281e45ab45c3f0e33e2ce44",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cece73c280a846a3f967f7cedc493ff49f03d3b40b4ba0e77e8bc80434f18dfc",
      "text": "沉浸在忘年会的余韵中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e73cd896f66dd802cdba9d0abbc85b94874a2227efaa28d45e9d9882865b4c",
      "text": "迎来了新年的315 Production。\n偶像们换上崭新的心情，\n与制作人互致问候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4a89b571c5fe9946731c72d9e2b3def628ec6974f5d26bed3a804640fbc5da2",
      "text": "是●●●●プロデューサー吗？\n新年快乐。只能用电话联络实在抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c58c605b2ecea3afaba12ea7db2ceb2fc14aeb8fd428a4cb8b44a8607c4e562",
      "text": "改日会再正式登门拜访，在此先向您致以新年的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebaedd35a74de75ffaa7d7ceb15bccec72105fcd26c6883a1181be0e93f70108",
      "text": "Good morning，制作人酱！\n哎呀？已经是中午了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c35c479160904e61bb00a0869eed18b83920980b60fc356485e87cc5fc5b1d1",
      "text": "Happy new year！今年也请多关照咯☆\n快来快来，Mr. 山下也来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e84cf94078c1343cb9b54bfded25220c60045bcd077eda605cbe5c25033194ce",
      "text": "诶，电话？啊，是制作人酱啊。\n新年快乐，今年也请多关照呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000028:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f41e1d5a53e9a491f648274fddf157b9253d048c0a750385cc58c143911b7b47",
      "text": "新年快乐",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82897636ef848d15633bd37c2dab9561925e995878363cafb84522a1b9c15500",
      "text": "今年也请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb327360d2ea8b6ae7baaebeeacf785395b1b44f2081a585cf3f2cdb7877f382",
      "text": "不好意思啊。忘年会气氛太热烈了，喝到很晚，\n大叔我现在稍微有点困……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57e7f8d604048db3c8743014ca1b89c3ae0be6c659e059e91630528f835b5b37",
      "text": "既然这样，那就把话筒还给\n演播室的硲先生啦～。哈欠……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c170f5b27097c3247ca17c530aa6cb5622f4f9f66527dd84ddf744e4a756158",
      "text": "Oh！你又要睡了吗！？\n好不容易醒了，再多聊会儿嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_012_23_5_00_012_23:5_00_012_23:cmd-000041:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce05429527f2811d0d17ebd8a006d8cf02824948b9c2e9f214f4a5663c55ce90",
      "text": "喂喂，我是硲。抱歉，先在这边把\n电话挂断了。那么，今年也拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
